Komand'r grew up hated by the Tamaran population, who denied her birthright and refused to allow her to be the next Princess of Tamaran. All of her queenly privileges, honors, and celebration were later given to her younger sister, Starfire. Komand'r's rage grew inward, and whenever she could, her hatred for her planet was focused on her hapless sister.

